# Topic: AI Personal Finance Assistant
- Today, Module 4 – Financial Report Generation and Data Visualization was successfully implemented and updated on GitHub. This module helps users generate financial reports, visualize income and expense data, and analyze financial performance through charts and summaries using an interactive and user-friendly interface.
# Features:
• Generate financial summary reports
• Visualize income and expense data using charts
• Monthly and category-wise financial analysis
• Interactive dashboard for financial tracking
• Easy-to-understand report generation system
# Advantages:
• Helps users understand financial performance clearly
• Improves financial analysis and decision-making
• Provides visual representation of spending habits
• Supports better budgeting and savings planning
• Enhances overall financial monitoring efficiency
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Budget Prediction</title>

    <style>

        body{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            font-family:Arial;
            background:#f4f6f9;
        }

        .navbar{
            background:linear-gradient(to right,#1d2671,#c33764);
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:20px;
            font-size:30px;
            font-weight:bold;
        }

        .container{
            width:80%;
            margin:auto;
            margin-top:40px;
        }

        .card{
            background:white;
            padding:30px;
            border-radius:15px;
            margin-bottom:25px;
            box-shadow:0px 0px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            text-align:center;
        }

        h2{
            color:#1d2671;
            margin-bottom:20px;
        }

        p{
            font-size:28px;
            color:#c33764;
            font-weight:bold;
        }

        a{
            text-decoration:none;
        }

        button{
            padding:14px 25px;
            background:#1d2671;
            color:white;
            border:none;
            border-radius:10px;
            font-size:18px;
            cursor:pointer;
        }

        button:hover{
            background:#c33764;
        }

    </style>

</head>
<body>

    <div class="navbar">
        Budget Prediction System
    </div>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Total Expense</h2>
            <p>₹ {{ total }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Average Expense</h2>
            <p>₹ {{ average }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Predicted Monthly Budget</h2>
            <p>₹ {{ predicted_budget }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Estimated Savings</h2>
            <p>₹ {{ savings }}</p>
        </div>

        <center>

            <a href="/dashboard">

                <button>
                    Back to Dashboard
                </button>

            </a>

        </center>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
